2. CSS du tableau

.files-table-wrapper {
  width: 100%;
  overflow-x: auto;
}

.files-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;

  table-layout: fixed;

  font-size: 13px;
  color: #334155;
}

/* =========================
   HEADER
========================= */

.files-table thead {
  background: #f8fafc;
}

.files-table th {
  height: 42px;

  padding: 0 12px;

  border-bottom: 1px solid #e5eaf1;

  color: #64748b;

  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;

  text-align: left;

  white-space: nowrap;
}

.files-table th:first-child {
  width: 42px;
}

.files-table th:nth-child(2) {
  width: 36%;
}

.files-table th:nth-child(3) {
  width: 100px;
}

.files-table th:nth-child(4) {
  width: 100px;
}

.files-table th:nth-child(5) {
  width: 170px;
}

.files-table th:last-child {
  width: 90px;
  text-align: center;
}

/* =========================
   ROW
========================= */

.files-table tbody tr {
  height: 52px;

  border-bottom: 1px solid #eef1f5;

  transition:
    background-color 0.15s ease;
}

.files-table tbody tr:hover {
  background: #f8fbff;
}

.files-table td {
  padding: 0 12px;

  vertical-align: middle;

  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* =========================
   FILE NAME
========================= */

.file-table-name {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;

  gap: 10px;

  min-width: 0;
}

.file-table-name span {
  min-width: 0;

  overflow: hidden;

  text-overflow: ellipsis;

  white-space: nowrap;

  color: #1e293b;

  font-weight: 600;
}

.file-table-icon {
  width: 30px;
  height: 30px;

  flex-shrink: 0;

  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;

  border-radius: 7px;

  background: #f1f5f9;

  font-size: 16px;
}

/* =========================
   TYPE
========================= */

.file-type-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;

  height: 24px;

  padding: 0 9px;

  border-radius: 7px;

  background: #eef2f7;

  color: #64748b;

  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* =========================
   ACTIONS
========================= */

.file-table-actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;

  gap: 4px;
}

.file-table-actions button {
  width: 30px;
  height: 30px;

  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;

  border: 0;
  border-radius: 7px;

  background: transparent;

  color: #64748b;

  cursor: pointer;

  font-size: 17px;

  transition:
    background-color 0.15s ease,
    color 0.15s ease;
}

.file-table-actions button:hover {
  background: #edf2f7;
  color: #1769ff;
}

/* =========================
   CHECKBOX
========================= */

.files-table input[type="checkbox"] {
  width: 15px;
  height: 15px;

  cursor: pointer;

  accent-color: #1769ff;
}

.file-check-column {
  text-align: center !important;
}

3. Pour afficher PDF, DOCX, XLSX

Je ne conseille pas d'afficher directement :

file.contentType

car tu risques d'avoir :

application/pdf
application/vnd.openxmlformats...

À la place :

function getFileType(fileName: string) {
  const extension =
    fileName
      .split(".")
      .pop()
      ?.toUpperCase()

  return extension || "FILE"
}

Puis :

<span className="file-type-badge">
  {getFileType(file.fileName)}
</span>

Tu obtiendras :

PDF
DOCX
XLSX
PNG
TXT
ZIP

